 "summary": "A single 100 V N-channel enhancement power MOSFET of Infineon's OptiMOS 5 family in the TOLL package (PG-HSOF-8): one gate lead, seven source leads and a drain tab. RDS(on) is 1.5 mΩ max at 10 V gate drive and 2.0 mΩ max at 6 V, and it is rated for 353 A continuous with the case held at 25 °C. Typical gate charge is 169 nC and output charge 213 nC; it targets fast switching and synchronous rectification, and each unit is avalanche tested.",
